{"type":"text","timestamp":1792370414947,"sessionID":"ses_eae696a14ffehCxB980snPYjCy","part":{"id":"prt_15199fec9001MAMUkp07own5HK","messageID":"msg_15199e4640014KdKhN00VZA5H5","sessionID":"ses_eae696a14ffehCxB980snPYjCy","type":"text","text":"## Objective\n- Perform a READ-ONLY audit of the \"Controls and everyday play\" lane (THE HAND + THE FIGHT) in the SpaceFace repo, hunting concrete player-facing defects in input/camera/pause/rebinding behaviour and reporting them as markdown findings (`F-CONTROLS-NN`) to stdout.\n- Workflow scoped by build_map.md §1.8 coverage table; final output must end with `VERDICT: <N findings / clean>`.\n\n## Important Details\n- HARD RULES: READ any file; may run `node --test test/<file>.test.mjs` and non-browser `node scripts/check-*.mjs` / `npm run check:*`. NEVER edit/create/delete/rename files, never run mutating git (only status/diff/log/show), no `npm install`, no writes.\n- NO browser/Electron/GPU probes (no Chrome/Chromium/Electron/playwright/puppeteer scripts).\n- Working tree is dirty with OTHER agents' live work (`src/render/**`, `src/systems/{mining,npcJobsRuntime,wingmen}.js`, `src/ui/screens/{flightFootage,footageVideoCodec}.js`). Suspicious dirty files must be marked \"foreign-lane file dirty\" and auditing continues elsewhere.\n- Sim invariants when judging code: sim uses XZ plane, `state.rng`/`state.simTime`, no wall-clock randomness.\n- Cover: ordinary flight, targeting, mining, towing, fighting, camera/zoom; pause/settings/modal→resume; held/released inputs, rebinding, focus changes. Bar: input answers once, camera and body agree, closing a screen never leaves stuck controls/accidental actions/unusable ship.\n- Finding format (repeat per finding, max 6, real ones only): `### F-CONTROLS-NN` with `symptom` (player words), `severity` (crash|progress-loss|softlock|major|minor|polish), `route`, `owner: <file:function/line>`, `evidence` (code path + command output), `suggested_fix` (1-2 sentences), `confidence` (high|medium|low). Clean verdict is valid if nothing material found.\n- Report finds as markdown on stdout — ONLY output.\n\n## Work State\n### Completed\n- Read build_map.md §1.8 (~lines 310-390) for the bar.\n- Ran `git status --short`; tree dirty (many `assets/ships/release/render-packages/*/render-package.json` modified).\n- Located owner files and line counts: `src/systems/input.js` (2214), `src/ui/input.js` (1315), `src/render/camera.js` (2319), `src/ui/screens/pause.js` (1175).\n- Read `src/systems/input.js` (head, ~1105-1704, ~1704-1850), `src/ui/input.js` (head, ~1095-1315 including dispose), `src/ui/screens/pause.js` (head/partial).\n- Ran owner tests — ALL PASS: `test/input-lifecycle.test.mjs`, `test/input-modal-release-boundary.test.mjs`, `test/input-pointer-lock-recovery.test.mjs`, `test/native-focus-input-release.test.mjs` (release-only-once-per-occluded-edge, fence revokes pointer lock, holds released on blur). Second batch also 12 pass / 0 fail: `test/input-gamepad-capture-boundary.test.mjs`, `test/cinematic-input-fence.test.mjs`, `test/shell-focus-pause-release.test.mjs`, `test/toast-modal-focus-fast-follow.test.mjs`.\n- Reviewed `src/render/camera.js` zoom machinery (`resolveThreatZoomBias`, `CONTEXT_ZOOM_MAX=0.20`, `CONTEXT_ZOOM_DAMP_HALF_LIFE_S=0.6`, `createPhotoModeState`/`applyPhotoPresentation`).\n- Traced `camera:zoom`: emitted in `src/ui/input.js:626-627` (Equal/NumpadAdd → delta -8; Minus/NumpadSubtract → delta 8) and `src/ui/input.js:867` (wheel); consumed in `src/render/renderer.js:20607` (`cam.setZoom(state.camera.zoom + (delta||0))`).\n- Reviewed rebinding capture in `src/ui/screens/settings.js` `_capture` (~line 1346): uses `window.addEventListener('keydown', onKey, true)`, calls `ev.preventDefault()/stopPropagation()`, guards stale close via `this._activeCapture !== done`.\n- Searched `design/program/DEMO_READINESS_2026-09-20.md` §6 defect ledger for control/input/pause rows (noted FEEL_CONTRACT B3b input→photon ≤50 ms, frame-loop ordering rows).\n\n### Active\n- Hunting concrete defects; no material finding confirmed yet. Areas under scrutiny: rebind double-fire, capture vs flight listener ordering, pause gating input, camera fighting player input, zoom event paths.\n\n### Blocked\n- (none) — all run tests green; no failing command.\n\n## Next Move\n1. Read root `AGENTS.md` and finish `build_map.md` §1.8 (line ~310-390) fully; inspect remaining owner files likely to hold defects: `src/ui/bindings.js`, `src/ui/screens/settings.js` (full `_capture`), `src/render/camera.js` zoom/`setZoom` path, `src/render/renderer.js:20607` handler, `src/core/inputCommandSnapshot.js`, `src/systems/gamepad.js`.\n2. Probe candidate defects (pause not gating input, edge-triggered actions repeating, dead zones, zoom after modal, held key across focus change); confirm with targeted `node --test test/<file>.test.mjs` and emit findings + final `VERDICT:` line.\n\n## Relevant Files\n- `build_map.md` §1.8 (~lines 310-390): workflow bar/coverage table for this lane.\n- `design/program/DEMO_READINESS_2026-09-20.md` §6: open-defect ledger cross-check.\n- `src/systems/input.js` (2214 lines): keyboard/mouse sampling, control schemes, lane DOM ingest (`ingestLaneDomEvent`, `releaseHeldControls`), `resolveActionLabel`/`selectedWorldSiteTarget` exports.\n- `src/ui/input.js` (1315 lines): UI key router (ESC/pause, map, Tab target, camera zoom passthrough), gamepad UI, `dispose()`.\n- `src/ui/screens/pause.js` (1175 lines): pause screen; `ScreenManager` owns pause/resume aggregate.\n- `src/ui/screens/settings.js`: rebinding `_capture` (~line 1346); imports BINDINGS/setGamepadCaptureHandler.\n- `src/ui/bindings.js`: `BINDINGS`, `setGamepadCaptureHandler`, `getGamepadCaptureHandler`, prompt device/glyph setters.\n- `src/render/camera.js` (2319 lines): zoom/containment machinery; `createPhotoModeState`, `applyPhotoPresentation`.\n- `src/render/renderer.js:20607`: `camera:zoom` handler (`cam.setZoom`).\n- `src/ui/crucibleFocus.js:169,174`: emits `camera:zoom` `{level}` save/restore.\n- `src/core/mainToSimEventSurface.js:202`: `camera:zoom` event surface registration.\n- `test/`: `input-lifecycle`, `input-modal-release-boundary`, `input-pointer-lock-recovery`, `native-focus-input-release`, `input-gamepad-capture-boundary`, `cinematic-input-fence`, `shell-focus-pause-release`, `toast-modal-focus-fast-follow` (all currently passing); many `camera-*.test.mjs` and `*flight*.test.mjs` also present.","time":{"start":1792370409161,"end":1792370414940}}}
